values ('f7a8b9c0-1d2e-4f77-8a48-5b6c7d8e9f07', 'marketing-research', 'Marketing Research', 'A world-class version needs deeper treatment of mixed-method design, measurement validity, data quality, experiments and causal evidence, segmentation analytics, digital behavioral data, privacy, bias, responsible insights, and executive storytelling. The resulting syllabus covers core topics while expanding them into a decision-oriented, analytics-aware research course.');

